-- PML-STUDY-EXTR-002 / query pack 01
-- Required E3D observations for candidate 01.
--
-- How to run:
--   1. Load candidate 01 under a writable ZONE.
--   2. Make each SUBEQUIPMENT current in turn and run:
--        $M <this file>
--   3. Record the Q output and screenshot the visible result.
--
-- What to capture per SUBEQUIPMENT:
--   - Q ATT on each primitive: EXTRUSION HEIG, CYLINDER DIAM/HEIG, BOX
