--   - In Design Explorer, confirm the VERTEX children of each EXTRUSION:
--     rail 8, cleats 6, hex nuts 6.
--   - Visible confirmation that every part touches its neighbour and the
--     lowest point of the frame sits at U 0.
Q ATT
